  "notes": "Transcribed from the official SCC 'Design and Digital Media A.S. Degree - Local GE' program map, Catalog 2026-27, published August 10, 2026 (mapmaker.losrios.edu/Maps/7491/PublishedPdf). GE Pattern: SCC Local GE. Official Total Units: 60-61; this seed models the first-listed/recommended low path = 15 + 15 + 16 + 14 = 60 units (ENGL C1000 at 3 units per the official SCC English course page). Semester sums verified against the map's 15-16 / 15 / 16 / 14 headers. 4 terms (within the AA/AS 4-7 gate). Distinct from map 7721 (sacramento-city-college-as-design-and-digital-media), which is the Cal-GETC GE version of the same program. Major Elective (List A, documented): minimum 30 units from ANIM 301, ANIM 302+, ANIM 303+, ANIM 307, ANIM 495, DDSN 301, DDSN 302+, DDSN 303+, DDSN 305, DDSN 306, DDSN 311, DDSN 312+, DDSN 331, DDSN 332+, DDSN 333+, DDSN 335+, DDSN 341, DDSN 342+, DDSN 360, DDSN 361+, DDSN 362+, DDSN 370, DDSN 390+, DDSN 391+, DDSN 392+, DDSN 393+, DDSN 495, GAME 301, GAME 303+, GAME 495, MODL 301, MODL 302+, MODL 495. Selections (10 courses, 30 units, prerequisite-respecting sequence): Sem 1: DDSN 301, DDSN 311. Sem 2: DDSN 302 (prereq DDSN 301 in-plan), DDSN 331, DDSN 341. Sem 3: DDSN 303 (prereq DDSN 311 in-plan), DDSN 312 (prereq DDSN 311 in-plan). Sem 4: DDSN 332 (prereq DDSN 331 in-plan), DDSN 342 (prereq DDSN 341 in-plan), DDSN 305. Prerequisites documented per the map: ANIM 302 requires ANIM 301; ANIM 303 requires ANIM 302 or MODL 301; DDSN 302 requires DDSN 301; DDSN 303 requires DDSN 311 or 341; DDSN 312 requires DDSN 311; DDSN 332/333/335 require DDSN 331; DDSN 342 requires DDSN 341; DDSN 361 requires DDSN 360; DDSN 362 requires CISW 306 and DDSN 361; DDSN 390 requires five finished works; DDSN 391 requires one of ANIM 301/DDSN 311/DDSN 331/DDSN 341/DDSN 360/DDSN 361/MODL 301; DDSN 392 requires DDSN 391; DDSN 393 requires DDSN 392; GAME 303 requires GAME 301 and MODL 302; MODL 302 requires MODL 301. Choice slots: (1) GE INDIS 313 / HCD 310, Life Development Skills, SCC Local Area L7B — INDIS 313 selected (first-listed; first-time FYE students take INDIS 313); (2) GE ENGL C1000 / ENGL 488 / ESLW 340, SCC Local Area L1A — ENGL C1000 selected (3 units). Students not placing directly in MATH 300 take MATHS 95/MATH 300 combo. Electives: any courses numbered 100-499 (see a counselor). AA/AS requirements: 60 degree-applicable units with 2.0 GPA, 12 units within Los Rios, each required course 'C' or better, SCC Local GE Areas L1A-L7B. Bachelor's-degree holders are deemed to have satisfied GE/graduation competency (per map). Design & Digital Media, Arts & Communication Meta Majors.",
